  "display_name": "stexa-ai/voice-mcp",
  "description": "Connect voice telephony to your AI agent. Make outbound calls, get transcripts, check call status — all via MCP tools. Built on Asterisk + Yandex SpeechKit. OAuth 2.1, FZ-152 compliant.\n",
